-- Matt 26 reading-target: the chapter consolidates the passion-
-- architecture the prior chapters have prefigured. The extras-library
-- adds five framework-bearing thread-clusters at the load-bearing-and-
-- not-already-named architectures (rather than re-stating prior threads
-- where Matt 26 calls-back to them — S146-Matt-16's righteous-one-
-- condemned-shameful-death thread, S154-Matt-17's Son-of-Adam-glorified
-- thread, and S155-Matt-20's cup-of-suffering thread all call-back at
-- Matt 26 but each gets a NEW thread at a load-bearing-not-already-
-- named architecture instead of member-additions, because Matt 26's
-- specific narrative-movements (Passover-meal / Gethsemane-cup-of-
-- Yahuah's-wrath / shepherd-smitten / Sanhedrin-trial-Daniel-7-Psalm-
-- 110-confluence / Kefa-denial) each carry their own distinctive
-- substance worth a chapter-anchored thread). The seed-mechanism per
-- framework-deep's *Paternal Seed and the Marriage-Covenant Absorption*
-- section + Red Line #7 augmentation does not surface in Matt 26 (no
-- foreign-origin individuals or seed-distinction substance — the
-- chapter is internal to the disciples and the Sanhedrin-substance, all
-- within-the-covenant-people).
--
--   Thread 1 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Enoch 46 + 48 + 62 + 63's Son-of-
--     Adam-Parables Elect-One-vindicated-on-the-throne + kings-and-
--     the-mighty-condemned architecture — the wisdom-stream's
--     direct articulation of the substantial-confluence at v.64 of
--     the substantial Psalm 110:1 + Daniel 7:13-14 substance. Note
--     on the kaph-comparative-narrow-rule (Red Line #12): Matt 26:64
--     reads the substantial-title *the Son of Adam* directly (the
--     Greek does NOT carry the *hōs* / *homoion* comparative); the
--     Daniel 7:13 verse-the-King-quotes preserves the kaph at the
--     Aramaic-source-register (*kbar enash* = like a son of mortal-
--     man) the framework-note carries; the 1 Enoch Parables name
--     the substantial-Son-of-Adam at the title-direct-register the
--     wisdom-stream walks-as the named-figure-standing-beside-the-
--     Head-of-Days (NOT the kaph-comparative-substance the Daniel
--     7:13 text-itself preserves). The substantial-Son-of-Adam-
--     substance at Matt 26:64 walks-substantively-the-named-figure
--     the 1 Enoch Parables had named-substantively-the-substance-
--     for centuries before.
--   Thread 2 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Maccabees + 2 Maccabees' new-
--     covenant-meal-of-the-suffering-righteous + faithful-unto-death-
--     for-the-covenant architecture — the wisdom-stream's direct
