--     -Yashar'el (Israel) substance — the wisdom-stream's articulation
--     of the substantial-Gethsemane-cup-of-suffering substance the
--     King drinks-substantively at vv.36-46. The framework reads the
--     4 Maccabees substance carefully — 4 Macc 13:18's *propitiation
--     of their death* and *ransom* substance is the substantial-
--     pre-figuring of the King's-substantial-substantial-substance
--     at-the-Gethsemane-Cross-substance, NOT-substantially-the-
--     forensic-substitutionary-juridical-transaction-substance the
--     inherited-Reformation-Anselmian-Calvinist-collapse walks. The
--     substantial-Maccabean-faithful-servants-substance walks-the-
--     prefiguring-pattern; the King-of-Yashar'el (Israel)-as-the-
--     Pesach-lamb-substance walks-the-substantial-fulfillment.
--   Thread 4: Testaments of the XII Patriarchs (Test. Levi 17 + Test.
--     Benjamin) shepherd-smitten + temple-veil-rent + corrupt-high-
--     priesthood-at-the-end-of-the-ages + blameless-one-defiled-for-
--     lawless-men-in-the-blood-of-the-covenant substance — the
--     wisdom-stream's direct articulation of (a) the substantial-
--     Zechariah 13:7 shepherd-smitten substance at Matt 26:31, 56, (b)
