-- than re-adding members to S146/S154's thread here at Matt 26, the
-- framework reads Matt 26's Sanhedrin-trial through the S146/S154
-- thread's already-established Wisdom of Solomon 2 prefiguring (the
-- thread's anchor-architecture extends-naturally through the passion-
-- narrative without requiring additional member-rows at every passion-
