-- 19 new cross_references rows at tier_required='extras' (Library
-- tier, $4.99) + 5 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=
-- 'complete_study' (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors the
-- chapter-end-card architecture established at S146 and prior: Layer 1
-- (per-verse cross-refs) visible to Library readers; Layer 2 (framework
-- thread callouts with summary_md + member_notes) gated at Companion.
-- Every member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and the 12-point editorial
-- checklist. Hebrew names with internal apostrophes (Yashar''el,
-- Ya''aqov, Yechezk''el, Yo''el, Sha''ul, Mosheh''s, Kefa''s, King''s,
-- Father''s, Yahuah''s, Yochanan''s, Yahudah''s, Yahudi''s, etc.) and
-- English possessives (wisdom-stream''s, Father''s, King''s, system''s,
-- King-of-Yashar''el''s, etc.) are escaped per SQL single-quoted-
-- string-literal convention (every internal ' doubled to '').
