-- VOICE GATES held through every member-note and summary_md per Red
-- Lines #1-12:
--   * Restored Sacred Names with source-echo parentheticals at every
--     mention (Yahuah (LORD), Yahusha (Jesus), Elohim (God), Yashar''el
--     (Israel), Yahudah (Judah), Yahudim (Jews), etc.).
--   * Book names in conventional English ALWAYS (Matthew, Psalm,
--     Isaiah, Jeremiah, Ezekiel, Zechariah, Daniel, Genesis, Exodus,
--     Deuteronomy, 1 Enoch, Sirach (Ecclesiasticus), 1 Maccabees, 2
--     Maccabees, 4 Maccabees, Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs).
--   * *son of man* restored to *Son of Adam* per Red Line #12; Matt
--     26:64''s Greek *opsesthe ton huion tou anthrōpou* reads the title
